# Push every change

After any code or content change in this repo, create a git commit and `git push` to the remote in the same turn. Do not wait to be asked.

Use author `Luke Carter <everythingsimpleinc1@gmail.com>` via env vars on the commit. Never skip hooks. Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, or secrets.
